INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(79,'According to the study material, what is the fundamental concept that Artificial Intelligence (AI) refers to?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: "Artiﬁcial Intelligence (AI) refers to the simulation of human intelligence in machines which allows them to think and act like humans." Option C directly reflects this definition.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.852033','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(80,'What is an AI agent primarily defined as in the provided study material?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The text defines an AI agent as "a software or hardware entity that performs actions autonomously with the goal of achieving speciﬁc objectives." Option B directly matches this definition.','Remember, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.858635','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(81,'A logistics AI is designed to balance speed, cost, and fuel use. Which key feature of an AI agent does this example best illustrate?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: "Goal ‑ driven: Optimize for deﬁned objectives like a logistics AI balancing speed, cost and fuel use." The example directly corresponds to the ''Goal-driven'' feature.','Analyze, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.868767','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(82,'A cybersecurity agent continuously tracks new threats by gathering information from various inputs. This action primarily demonstrates which key feature of an AI agent?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material describes ''Perceptive'' as: "Gather info from sensors, inputs or APIs like a cybersecurity agent tracking new threats." The scenario directly matches this description.','Analyze, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.874849','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(83,'What is the primary function of an AI agent''s Action Module?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: "The action module executes the decisions made by the planning module in the real world. It translates decisions into real-world actions." Option C directly reflects this function.','Remember, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.878631','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(84,'A chatbot''s ability to remember past conversations to provide better responses is an example of which AI agent module at work?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material describes the Learning Module as: "helps the agent learn from prior actions and improve over time. For example: A chatbot remembers past conversations to give better responses." The scenario directly matches this example.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.880649','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(85,'Which AI agent module is primarily responsible for evaluating situations and selecting the most effective course of action?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: "Planning Module: This module is responsible for decision-making. It evaluates situations, weighs alternatives and selects the most effective course of action." Option C aligns with this description.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.882663','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(86,'A warehouse system utilizes multiple robots that operate without a central controller and can continue functioning even if some robots fail. What is the most significant advantage highlighted by this characteristic of the multi-agent system?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Evaluate','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The text states that multi-agent systems "Operate without a central controller, with decisions distributed across agents" and "Remain robust even if some agents fail or stop functioning." This directly points to enhanced robustness and fault tolerance as the significant advantage.','Evaluate, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.882663','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(87,'When an AI agent is described as ''adaptable'', what does this primarily mean it can do?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines ''Adaptable'' as: "Adjust strategies when situations change." Option C directly matches this definition.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.884671','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(88,'The feature of an AI agent that allows it to work with humans or other agents toward shared goals is known as what?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines ''Collaborative'' as: "Work with humans or other agents toward shared goals like healthcare agents coordinating with patients and doctor." Option D directly matches this definition.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 02:13:33.886678','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(89,'A cybersecurity agent tracks new threats, an example of a ''Perceptive'' feature. How does this feature primarily contribute to the agent''s overall goal-driven operation?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines ''Perceptive'' as gathering information from sensors, inputs, or APIs. This information is crucial for the agent to make informed decisions and achieve its defined objectives, thus contributing to its goal-driven operation.','Analyze, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.288840','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(90,'Which of the following best describes the fundamental nature of an AI agent?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Easy','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material explicitly states, ''An AI agent is a software or hardware entity that performs actions autonomously with the goal of achieving speciﬁc objectives.''','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.296074','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(91,'According to the provided material, what is the primary objective of Artificial Intelligence?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Easy','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines Artificial Intelligence (AI) as ''the simulation of human intelligence in machines which allows them to think and act like humans.''','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.296074','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(92,'A bookstore bot that flags missing invoices based on past data exemplifies an AI agent''s ''Autonomous'' feature. What is the most significant implication of this characteristic for the agent''s operation?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines ''Autonomous'' as the ability to ''Act without constant human input and decide next steps from past data.'' This directly implies operating and making decisions independently of continuous human intervention.','Analyze, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.303714','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(93,'Consider a system designed to manage traffic flow in a city. Which of the following actions would best demonstrate its ''Goal-driven'' feature as an AI agent?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Hard','Evaluate','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines ''Goal-driven'' as optimizing for defined objectives, providing the example of a logistics AI balancing speed, cost, and fuel use. Adjusting traffic light timings to minimize congestion and optimize travel time directly aligns with optimizing for specific, defined objectives.','Evaluate, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.303714','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(94,'A robot vacuum detects dirt and then moves to clean the designated area. This sequence involves the interaction of which two AI agent modules?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states the ''Planning Module'' is responsible for decision-making (e.g., deciding to clean after detecting dirt), and the ''Action Module'' executes these decisions in the real world (e.g., moving to clean).','Analyze, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.307917','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(95,'A warehouse system where robots navigate, plan tasks, prioritize work, and improve routes through learning, and where decisions are distributed across agents without a central controller, best exemplifies which characteristic?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material explicitly states that systems operating without a central controller and with distributed decisions ''Remain robust even if some agents fail or stop functioning.''','Analyze, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.310898','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(96,'What is the primary role of the Learning Module within an AI agent''s architecture?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Easy','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines the ''Learning Module'' as the component that ''helps the agent learn from prior actions and improve over time,'' citing a chatbot remembering past conversations as an example.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.312070','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(97,'A chess-playing AI plans its moves based on future possibilities. This action is primarily facilitated by which module of the AI agent?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states the ''Planning Module'' is ''responsible for decision-making. It evaluates situations, weighs alternatives and selects the most effective course of action,'' directly aligning with a chess AI planning its moves.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.314465','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(98,'Artiﬁcial Intelligence (AI) is defined as the simulation of human intelligence in machines that allows them to perform which of the following?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Easy','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material explicitly defines AI as ''the simulation of human intelligence in machines which allows them to think and act like humans.''','Remember, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 14:38:27.316579','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(99,'A bookstore bot is designed to automatically flag missing invoices by analyzing its historical sales data without requiring a human to manually check each transaction. Which key feature of an AI agent is best demonstrated by this bot''s capability?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Apply','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material explicitly states: ''Autonomous: Act without constant human input and decide next steps from past data like a bookstore bot flags missing invoices.'' This scenario directly applies the definition of an autonomous agent.','Apply, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.074006','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(100,'According to the provided study material, what does Artificial Intelligence (AI) primarily refer to?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: ''Artiﬁcial Intelligence (AI) refers to the simulation of human intelligence in machines which allows them to think and act like humans.''','Remember, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.086773','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(101,'A new AI system is being designed for a critical infrastructure monitoring role, requiring it to operate without constant human oversight and adjust its strategies when unforeseen situations arise. Based on the key features of an AI agent, which combination of features would be most crucial for this system''s success?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Evaluate','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The scenario requires ''without constant human oversight'' which aligns with ''Autonomous'' (''Act without constant human input'') and ''adjust its strategies when unforeseen situations arise'' which aligns with ''Adaptable'' (''Adjust strategies when situations change''). Therefore, the combination of Adaptable and Autonomous is most crucial.','Evaluate, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.092334','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(102,'How does the Planning Module contribute to an AI agent''s overall functionality?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: ''Planning Module: This module is responsible for decision-making. It evaluates situations, weighs alternatives and selects the most effective course of action.''','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.092334','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(103,'Which of the following is provided as an example of a Goal-driven AI agent in the study material?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: ''Goal ‑ driven: Optimize for deﬁned objectives like a logistics AI balancing speed, cost and fuel use.''','Remember, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.092334','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(104,'In the context of Artificial Intelligence, what is an AI agent defined as?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines an AI agent as: ''An AI agent is a software or hardware entity that performs actions autonomously with the goal of achieving speciﬁc objectives.''','Remember, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.092334','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(105,'What is the primary function of the Action Module within an AI agent system?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: ''Action Module: The action module executes the decisions made by the planning module in the real world. It translates decisions into real-world actions.''','Remember, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.092334','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(106,'An AI agent''s ability to support decision-making is primarily achieved by which of the following actions?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states that an AI agent ''Collects and analyzes data from its environment to support decision-making''. This directly explains how it supports decision-making.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.092334','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(107,'When an AI agent is described as ''Autonomous,'' what does this imply about its operational behavior?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material defines ''Autonomous'' as: ''Act without constant human input and decide next steps from past data like a bookstore bot flags missing invoices.'' This implies its ability to operate independently.','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.092334','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(108,'A chatbot that remembers past conversations to give better responses over time exemplifies the function of which AI agent module?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: ''Learning Module: helps the agent learn from prior actions and improve over time. For example: A chatbot remembers past conversations to give better responses.''','Understand, CO1',54,'2026-08-11 15:02:39.092334','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(109,'Analyze the warehouse system example provided in the study material. Which of the following options correctly maps the specific agent behaviors to their corresponding decision-making mechanisms?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Hard','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'According to the study material, the warehouse system example features robots that ''navigate using reflexes, plan tasks using goals, prioritize work using utility, and improve routes through learning.''','Analyze, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.087056','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(110,'A developer is designing an autonomous delivery drone. The drone needs to evaluate alternative flight paths to avoid a sudden storm and select the safest route. According to the agent modules described in the text, which module is responsible for this specific decision-making process?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Apply','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states that the Planning Module ''is responsible for decision-making. It evaluates situations, weighs alternatives and selects the most effective course of action.''','Apply, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.102956','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(111,'According to the study material, which of the following libraries and frameworks are specifically mentioned as tools used for artificial intelligence, machine learning, and data analysis?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Easy','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material explicitly lists ''Pandas, TensorFlow and Scikit-learn for artificial intelligence, machine learning and data analysis.''','Remember, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.112720','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(112,'In Python, if you have a single character variable defined as char_val = ''A'', how does Python treat this variable based on the rules of string handling described in the study material?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Apply','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states: ''Python does not have a separate character type. A single character is treated as a string of length one.''','Apply, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.115485','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(113,'Suppose you are designing a multi-layered control architecture for an autonomous search-and-rescue robot. Based on the organizational principles of hierarchical agents described in the text, how should you structure the responsibilities between the high-level and low-level agents?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Hard','Create','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The text states that hierarchical agents ''organize decision-making in layers, where higher levels focus on planning and lower levels handle execution'' and ''High-level agents focus on planning and coordination'' while ''Low-level agents handle execution.''','Create, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.119024','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(114,'A customer support chatbot is updated so that it remembers past conversations with a user to provide more personalized and context-aware responses in future interactions. Which agent module from the study material is directly applied in this scenario?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Apply','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states that the Learning Module ''helps the agent learn from prior actions and improve over time. For example: A chatbot remembers past conversations to give better responses.''','Apply, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.120336','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(115,'Which of the following is a key operational characteristic of multi-agent systems as described in the study material?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states that multi-agent systems ''Operate without a central controller, with decisions distributed across agents'' and ''Remain robust even if some agents fail or stop functioning.''','Understand, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.122876','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(116,'Based on the study material, why is Python''s code considered easier to write, understand, and maintain compared to some other languages?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Easy','Understand','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states that Python is ''Known for its readability, which means code is easier to write, understand and maintain'' and has a ''clean syntax'' which makes it beginner-friendly.','Understand, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.122876','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(117,'You are tasked with formulating the operational flow for a smart irrigation system. After the planning module decides to water the crops based on soil dryness, which design implementation represents the correct role of the Action Module?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Hard','Create','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states that the Action Module ''executes the decisions made by the planning module in the real world. It translates decisions into real-world actions. For example: A robot vacuum moves to clean a designated area after detecting dirt.'' Therefore, physically opening the water valve is the correct real-world action.','Create, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.122876','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(118,'According to the study material, what types of interactions can be included in multi-agent systems?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Easy','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material states that multi-agent systems ''Include different interaction types such as cooperative, competitive, and mixed agent behavior.''','Remember, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 04:31:55.122876','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(119,'A software development team is tasked with creating a new cross-platform AI application that requires extensive data analysis capabilities and needs to be developed with fewer lines of code for faster deployment. Based on the provided study material, which programming language would be the most suitable choice?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Apply','Multiple Choice',NULL,'Python is described as cross-platform, requiring fewer lines of code compared to Java, and providing libraries like Pandas, TensorFlow, and Scikit-learn for artificial intelligence, machine learning, and data analysis, making it suitable for the described project.','Apply, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.698828','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(120,'In a complex AI system designed to play strategic games like chess, the ability to evaluate various future possibilities and select the most effective course of action is paramount. Based on the agent modules described, which module''s robust functioning is most critical for achieving optimal strategic decision-making in such a system?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Hard','Evaluate','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The Planning Module is explicitly stated as being ''responsible for decision-making. It evaluates situations, weighs alternatives and selects the most effective course of action,'' with a chess-playing AI given as an example, making it critical for strategic decision-making.','Evaluate, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.713363','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(121,'According to the study material, what is a fundamental characteristic of strings in Python?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Easy','Remember','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The study material explicitly states: ''Python does not have a separate character type. A single character is treated as a string of length one.''','Remember, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.713363','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(122,'A robotic arm in an automated factory receives a command to pick up a specific component after the central control system has determined the optimal sequence of operations. Which agent module is primarily responsible for translating this command into the physical movement of the robotic arm?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Apply','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The Action Module ''executes the decisions made by the planning module in the real world. It translates decisions into real-world actions,'' which directly corresponds to the physical movement of the robotic arm.','Apply, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.727321','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(123,'Hierarchical agents are structured with decision-making in layers. Based on the description, what is the primary analytical advantage of this layered structure for managing complex tasks?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The text states that the hierarchical structure ''helps manage complex tasks by separating strategy from operational details,'' with higher levels focusing on planning and lower levels handling execution.','Analyze, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.727321','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(124,'The study material describes certain agent behaviors that ''operate without a central controller, with decisions distributed across agents'' and ''remain robust even if some agents fail or stop functioning.'' What is the most significant evaluative benefit of this distributed decision-making and robustness characteristic in a system like a warehouse with multiple robots?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Hard','Evaluate','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The text states that such systems ''remain robust even if some agents fail or stop functioning.'' This directly implies that the system can continue to operate even if parts of it fail, thus preventing a single point of failure from crippling the entire system.','Evaluate, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.727321','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(125,'A data scientist needs to develop an AI application that involves extensive machine learning and data analysis, and the project requires a language known for its readability and strong community support. Based on the provided context, which combination of Python''s attributes makes it particularly well-suited for this scenario?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Analyze','Multiple Choice',NULL,'Python is ''Known for its readability,'' ''Backed by strong library support'' including ''Pandas, TensorFlow and Scikit-learn for artificial intelligence, machine learning and data analysis,'' and ''Used by top tech companies like Google, Netflix and NASA,'' which indicates strong community and industry support.','Analyze, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.727321','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(126,'An intelligent personal assistant is designed to adapt its responses and suggestions over time by remembering a user''s preferences and past interactions. Which specific agent module, as described in the study material, is primarily responsible for this adaptive behavior?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Apply','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The Learning Module ''helps the agent learn from prior actions and improve over time. For example: A chatbot remembers past conversations to give better responses.'' This directly applies to an intelligent assistant remembering user preferences and past interactions.','Apply, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.743375','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(127,'A smart home assistant is programmed to manage energy consumption. When a user requests to cool the house, the assistant first analyzes current temperature, external weather, and electricity prices, then determines the most cost-effective time and method to activate the air conditioning. Which AI agent module is primarily responsible for this analytical decision-making process?',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Apply','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The Planning Module is responsible for decision-making, evaluating situations, weighing alternatives, and selecting the most effective course of action. The scenario describes exactly this process of analysis and selection for activating air conditioning.','Apply, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.743375','Active');
INSERT INTO "questions" VALUES(128,'A team of developers is tasked with building a new Artificial Intelligence application that requires rapid prototyping, extensive data analysis capabilities, and deployment across various operating systems. Based on the characteristics of Python described in the study material, formulate a strategy for leveraging Python to meet these development requirements efficiently.',4,1,'Unit 1 Cognitive Topic',2.0,'Medium','Create','Multiple Choice',NULL,'The strategy involves leveraging Python''s strengths as described: ''fewer lines of code'' (rapid prototyping), ''cross-platform'' (broad deployment), and ''provides libraries and frameworks such as Pandas, TensorFlow and Scikit-learn for artificial intelligence, machine learning and data analysis'' (extensive data analysis capabilities).','Create, CO1',55,'2026-08-12 16:05:55.743375','Active');
